# The migration runner records a SHA-256 of every file in migrations/ and
# refuses to start against a database whose ledger disagrees, so a checkout
# that turned the line endings into CRLF is a deployment that cannot start.
# Only *.sql: web/src holds PNG and woff2 files, and the text attribute would
# rewrite the CR LF bytes inside them.
*.sql text eol=lf
